<title>USA: BOXING-TALE OF THE TAPE FOR MCCALL-LEWIS HEAVYWEIGHT TITLE BOUT.</title>
<headline>BOXING-TALE OF THE TAPE FOR MCCALL-LEWIS HEAVYWEIGHT TITLE BOUT.</headline>
